{"id":"n56106-1-7","stage":5,"title":"마취 · 麻醉","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56106-1-7-1","ko":"상처를 꿰맬 때 아프지 않았어?","zh":"缝伤口的时候不疼吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"상처를","meaning":"伤口，伤","explanation":"상처：伤口，伤；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"상처","audio":"/audio/005223fd14eafcaf1ee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62979","senseId":"1","lemma":"상처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상처를","audio":"/audio/6feb048e3ea05b0375df.mp3"}},{"text":"꿰맬","meaning":"缝补","explanation":"꿰매다：缝补；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"꿰매다","audio":"/audio/54b6a769a060a7bd691f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37785","senseId":"1","lemma":"꿰매다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꿰맬","audio":"/audio/b2f686b7f34647b6d0fc.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"아프지","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프지","audio":"/audio/3aba0a4a693d591131f7.mp3"}},{"text":"않았어?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았어","audio":"/audio/5a7720bef7cd2ac4fcc3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"005223fd14eafcaf","term":"상처","zh":"伤口，伤","audio":"/audio/005223fd14eafcaf1ee3.mp3","entryId":"62979","definition":"身体受伤而生出的伤处。","pronunciation":["상처"]},{"id":"54b6a769a060a7bd","term":"꿰매다","zh":"缝补","audio":"/audio/54b6a769a060a7bd691f.mp3","entryId":"37785","definition":"用针线缝住破旧或开了口的地方。","pronunciation":["꿰ː매다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/59d110f4c009ec2f4c0d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56106-1-7-2","ko":"마취를 해서 괜찮았어.","zh":"因为打了麻醉，所以没关系。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"마취를","meaning":"麻醉","explanation":"마취：麻醉；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"마취","audio":"/audio/9da79804f271056bcb55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56106","senseId":"1","lemma":"마취","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마취를","audio":"/audio/549cfa33e644b325df9d.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"하다：因为，由于；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"18","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮았어.","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮았어","audio":"/audio/78ec9451bfef2d85b176.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9da79804f271056b","term":"마취","zh":"麻醉","audio":"/audio/9da79804f271056bcb55.mp3","entryId":"56106","definition":"使生物在药物的作用下一时失去意识或知觉。","pronunciation":[